    <h1>Protection from Abuse</h1>
    <p>If someone is in immediate danger, call emergency services. Protection from abuse matters should use official court and safety resources.</p>
    <p>This safety fixture supports routing language and should not be used as legal advice.</p>

    <p>Protection from abuse hearing preparation may involve immediate danger, safety planning resources, service, family orders, child-contact restrictions, and official court forms. PFA hearing questions should be routed to safety resources and qualified legal review.</p>

